blueprint/src/chapter/ch12_qpbt_games.tex-52-	A \emph{two-player one-round game} $\mathfrak G$ is specified by a tuple $(\mathcal X, \mathcal Y, \mathcal A, \mathcal B, \mu, D)$ where
